# Refinement: Smart Optimization & Comparison UI

This plan addresses the "far route" detour issue and ensures the pothole counter provides clear comparison feedback even when a route is perfectly smooth.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Dense-only Avoidance**: To prevent huge detours caused by single isolated potholes, the **Smart Optimize** feature will now only avoid clusters of **3 or more potholes**. Isolated potholes will be handled via visual alerts rather than regional re-routing.
> **Comparison Visibility**: I will update the top navigation banner to always display the **total pothole count** for your selected path, so you can immediately see the "0" when comparing against rougher alternatives.

## Proposed Changes

### Logic Improvements

#### [MODIFY] [map_screen.dart](file:///c:/ssdd/flutter/lib/map_screen.dart)

- **Optimization Sensitivity**:
    - Update `_getAvoidancePolygons()` to filter out clusters with fewer than **3 potholes**.
    - Limit the returned polygons to the **Top 10 highest-density areas** to keep the route reasonable.

- **Persistent Pothole Summary**:
    - Introduce a new state variable `_activeRoutePotholeSummary`.
    - Update `_processRoutes` and `_selectAlternativeRoute` to calculate this summary (e.g., "5 Potholes found" or "Smooth Road (0 potholes)").
    - Update the top banner to display this summary instead of generic "Select a route" text.

### UI Enhancements

- **Navigation Banner**:
    - Ensure the top green/red card always shows the **total count** for the chosen route.
    - If 0 potholes, display a "✨ Smooth Journey" label.

- **Route Cards**:
    - Make the "0" more prominent (e.g., Use a bright green "Smooth" badge).

